    // If time left is:
    // - Less than 1 sec: format is 0.UUUUUU
    // - >= 1 sec and < 24 hrs: HH:MM:SS
    // - >= 24hrs and < 1 week: DD'd'HH'h' e.g.: 12d03h
    // - >= 1 week and < 1 year: WW'w'DD'd'
